+.It Ic copy Ar oldpath Ar newpath
+Copy remote file from
+.Ar oldpath
+to
+.Ar newpath .
+.Pp
+Note that this is only supported by servers that implement the "copy-data"
+extension.
+.It Ic cp Ar oldpath Ar newpath
